## Risks & Mitigations

| Risk                              | Mitigation                                   |
|----------------------------------|----------------------------------------------|
| Payment API downtime             | Use multiple gateways                        |
| Scalability under traffic spike  | Use load balancers and caching               |
| Ticket fraud or duplication      | Encrypt ticket payload, use QR-based tokens  |
| Organizer churn                  | Incentivize repeat usage, feedback loop      |

