## Cross-ticket Requirements
- Logging: redact sensitive data; include metrics for request success/failure.
- Secrets: use env variables only, add .env.example entries.
- Swagger: all endpoints documented with example payloads.
- Testing: README walkthrough.
- Security: HTTPS-only, rate-limited webhook endpoint.